@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@tokenA = REEMPLAZAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_A
@tokenB = REEMPLAZAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_B
@tokenC = REEMPLAZAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_C
@usernameA = gamer_a
@usernameB = gamer_b
@usernameC = gamer_c
# Copiar el id devuelto al crear una solicitud C -> A.
@requestCA = 1

### A consulta su configuración inicial: public / friends.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Preparación: A y B deben ser amigos (ver friends.http); C no debe ser amigo de A.
### A limita su perfil a amigos; History se guarda pero no se aplica a biblioteca/reseñas.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileVisibility":"friends","historyVisibility":"private"}

### B, amigo de A, ve bio, fecha y contador.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### C ve solo username, avatarUrl, relationship, isRestricted y restriction=friends_only.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### B puede ver los amigos de A: 200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}/friends?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### C no puede ver los amigos de A: 403 profile_restricted.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### A pasa a privado.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileVisibility":"private","historyVisibility":"friends"}

### B ahora ve restriction=private, incluso siendo amigo.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### A sigue viendo todo su perfil y sus amigos.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### C sigue encontrando a A en la búsqueda.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/search?q={{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### C puede enviar una solicitud al perfil privado (copiar id en requestCA).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{usernameA}}"}

### A acepta la solicitud de C.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestCA}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### A vuelve a perfil solo amigos.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileVisibility":"friends","historyVisibility":"friends"}

### C ahora ve el perfil completo inmediatamente.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### C elimina su amistad con A.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### C pierde el acceso inmediatamente.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### A vuelve a public; cualquier usuario autenticado puede ver el perfil.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileVisibility":"public","historyVisibility":"friends"}

### Valor inválido: 400 invalid_visibility; no modifica ninguno de los dos ajustes.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/privacy
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"profileVisibility":"private","historyVisibility":"invalid"}
